news.prompt:
A small-town newspaper of the time reports a street race.
Headline: {headline}
Story: {body}
Write it again as that paper would: the headline on the first line (at most eight words, no quotation marks), then the story in two to four sentences on the next line. Keep every name, car and figure, and add no names, places, cars or events the story does not have.

